0 Balance Engine — regenerated twin-piston shaking-force demonstrator
0 Name: balance-engine.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause
0 // Regenerated replacement, not a byte-for-byte recovery of the lost original.
0 // Two SPIKE medium motors A/B, one hub, passively centred orange carrier.
0 // Crank radius40 LDU; rod160 LDU; piston stroke80 LDU (32mm).
0 // Both saved cranks point +X. Run phases0/90/180 with matching encoder signs.
0 // Standard LDraw part references; all supports and fasteners are physical.
0 // Mount/guide stack derived from corrected BSD3 Quickstroke by CrispStrobe.
0 // Two physical 33mm transverse rubber bands prevent free-slider drift.
